# Kernel: Dinawari v0.2.22 — berjalan di atas Node.js/V8 (bukan bare metal).

## 1) Ring 1 — Kernel Core

```mermaid
flowchart TB
    V8["V8 / Node.js (Ring 0)"]
    K["Kernel.ts<br/>bootstrap & init (Dinawari)"]
    SC["Syscalls.ts<br/>60+ POSIX syscalls"]
    SCH["Scheduler.ts<br/>round-robin, signals, saved UID"]
    PM["PermissionManager<br/>UID/GID rwx"]
    MM["MountManager<br/>multi-VFS overlay"]
    PO["PortManager"]
    GR["GUIRegistry<br/>window → PID"]
    TM["TTYManager + virtual consoles"]
    R2["→ Ring 2: VFS & Devices"]
    R4["→ Ring 4: /bin/init.ts (PID 1)"]
    DOME["DOME (display server)"]

    V8 --> K
    K --> SC & SCH & PM & MM & PO & GR & TM
    SC --> R2
    SC --> SCH
    SCH --> R4
    GR --> DOME
```

